soptools (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Reorganize src/ by layer (util, model, engine, ui); drop redundant
    sop_ file prefixes.
  * Rename packaged sopenv/ to extension/bash for SOP script PATH
    helpers.
  * Split oversized GUI/runtime units to satisfy zfr lint source.long
    under -w.
  * Align packaging with zfr ize: bas-cpp i18n/logger, LOCALEDIR, locale
    man scaffolds, completions.
  * Ship WorldMan SOP packs (en/zh_CN/ja) with GPT .get capture,
    paste/render dialogs, and progress FIFO.

